OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening from the southwest through
OL,7,Fthe evening as rain and strengthening
OL,8,Fwinds soon arriving from the
OL,9,Fsouthwest. Some drier spells
OL,10,Fdeveloping by the end of the night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain expected, along with
OL,14,Fstrengthening winds. However some
OL,15,Fdrier intervals are also probable.
OL,16,FStrongest winds are likely to be
OL,17,Fthrough the evening, as rain clears
OL,18,Feast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
